gebruiken als tattoo. Het mag van alles zijn <3", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gedraji/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/251e6902/uploads/origins/2128413b-197d-4a96-8ebd-76a176ed9175?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e162ed0253baf3987a69ddecb7934a66", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/251e6902/uploads/origins/2128413b-197d-4a96-8ebd-76a176ed9175?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e162ed0253baf3987a69ddecb7934a66, https://si.imgix.net/251e6902/uploads/origins/2128413b-197d-4a96-8ebd-76a176ed9175?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=339cd3e003f7618a68a374988dbec30c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/251e6902/uploads/origins/2128413b-197d-4a96-8ebd-76a176ed9175?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=838572d6045177785b8d34a2035a8dc2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hallo! Ik stuur je dit verzoek omdat ik op zoek ben naar een opdracht voor een tekening van dit koppel: (Referenties bijgevoegd) https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HHbDJOq6NKguFWHyIAYWNdIc7CFjr0lc?usp=drive_link (Het zijn allebei mannen) Als specificaties dat ze er allebei ongeveer hetzelfde uitzien als hun referenties, maar dat ze op een bepaalde manier allebei een soort haat-liefde verhouding uitdrukken (Dat omvat elementen zoals bloed), ook zoek ik dat ze volledig menselijk zijn (Hoewel sommige referenties kemonomimi zijn). Dank je ☆⌒(*＾-゜)v\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HHbDJOq6NKguFWHyIAYWNdIc7CFjr0lc?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gedraji/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2058e9f/uploads/origins/17971921-a25b-4626-9889-e1ec5b23b9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c358899ae14669eb4b6d511299532fd9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b2058e9f/uploads/origins/17971921-a25b-4626-9889-e1ec5b23b9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c358899ae14669eb4b6d511299532fd9, https://si.imgix.net/b2058e9f/uploads/origins/17971921-a25b-4626-9889-e1ec5b23b9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82306a15c848be2aec7766a21f9face0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b2058e9f/uploads/origins/17971921-a25b-4626-9889-e1ec5b23b9f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c59df72890ef4d3be030c5f5dc29d11 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Twee kunstwerken. Een gedetailleerde en een doodle (vergelijkbaar met je vorige spam twitter profielfoto voordat je hem veranderde).\n\nDe kunst zou voor een shirt zijn, maar er zou er maar één voor mezelf worden gemaakt. Het zou nooit worden verkocht of als marketing worden gebruikt.\n\nHet gedetailleerde stuk is voor de achterkant van het shirt, de doodle is voor de voorkant bij de borst.\n\nAls het mogelijk is, kan de tekst \"Idolistic Love\" dan ergens op het detaillevel worden gezet.\n\nEr is geen achtergrond nodig voor het kunstwerk, iets als sterren of doodles rond het personage is prima.\n\nHet personage is hetzelfde voor zowel de doodle als het gedetailleerde werk.\n\nJe bent vrij om de outfit van het personage iets aan te passen als je dat wilt.\n\nAangezien dit op een zwart shirt zal zijn, zou het ook geweldig zijn als er iets als een witte omlijning rond het personage kan worden toegevoegd.\n\n-dobbelsteen\n\nhttps://x.com/dice_868/status/1880964931639824829", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gedraji/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/55237788/uploads/origins/37dec81c-35d6-42ee-afc7-42bef0286e4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=caefcc353062cb1ed83b0f5c674df488", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/55237788/uploads/origins/37dec81c-35d6-42ee-afc7-42bef0286e4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=caefcc353062cb1ed83b0f5c674df488, https://si.imgix.net/55237788/uploads/origins/37dec81c-35d6-42ee-afc7-42bef0286e4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9deb00a41bb968cca775f15194bbcbbe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/55237788/uploads/origins/37dec81c-35d6-42ee-afc7-42bef0286e4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca92505f1f04f38b168d3a82cc0d9a7b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nos gustaría algo de sangre (血腥表現) y sacar la lengua (tiene dos piercings en la lengua). Para el fondo, ⬇️ hueso de serpiente/rosa/sangre/cadena. Espero terminarlo alrededor del 8 de febrero🙏🏽", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gedraji/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/32e2a720/uploads/origins/56077f8c-10e3-4808-b08b-ef1e77079bee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9b6ef3f068aeeace6550f73fe7465f1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/32e2a720/uploads/origins/56077f8c-10e3-4808-b08b-ef1e77079bee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9b6ef3f068aeeace6550f73fe7465f1, https://si.imgix.net/32e2a720/uploads/origins/56077f8c-10e3-4808-b08b-ef1e77079bee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd1876a337547761c28ba9d389a3a868 2x, https://si.imgix.net/32e2a720/uploads/origins/56077f8c-10e3-4808-b08b-ef1e77079bee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ab0e1c4adafbb6c3cd6b55401487cbf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Suno icons, thank you! \nIf the request deadline expires again I don't mind at all to resubmit, don't rush yourself I have 0 issues waiting!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gedraji/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/957129e3/uploads/origins/90421bdb-c1d4-4a89-8542-4186f499f3ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5272b099f2c7f751cd8a945d5301656f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/957129e3/uploads/origins/90421bdb-c1d4-4a89-8542-4186f499f3ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5272b099f2c7f751cd8a945d5301656f, https://si.imgix.net/957129e3/uploads/origins/90421bdb-c1d4-4a89-8542-4186f499f3ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f63f8616fbfea58aebdc3312bed49898 2x, https://si.imgix.net/957129e3/uploads/origins/90421bdb-c1d4-4a89-8542-4186f499f3ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd2df70a36a99401bb56600f7b5b578e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! A friend of mine recommended you and I love your art!\n\nI'm a VTuber debuting in November and love Visual Kei even though my model isn't of the same style. I was hoping you could make a Visual Kei version of my model? I'll mostly be using this art as promotional material on X, but not as advertisements, rather post including the art. I plan on crediting you every time it's used.\n\nI was thinking a half body or less. If the amount isn't enough please resend the request and let me know the proper amount for what I'm looking for. Feel free to interpret my character in any way to fit your style. Whether that be adding piercings or changing the hair, as long as she is still recognizable as the character.\n\nShe is 170 cm and is a penguin themed explorer. The hex color I've mainly been using is #f5d461. I've included my model as well as an outfit I made in a fashion game that inspired this in the first place, You don't have to use it as an exact reference, just as an idea of my thoughts.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12OHPLd_YiYGLJRKv67ZpzuSsg0sFr7PU?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gedraji/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3d18d83a/uploads/origins/cbece493-628f-4461-8012-936183a0dca9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=356fdaa345328a4fad6935458538b09b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3d18d83a/uploads/origins/cbece493-628f-4461-8012-936183a0dca9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=356fdaa345328a4fad6935458538b09b, https://si.imgix.net/3d18d83a/uploads/origins/cbece493-628f-4461-8012-936183a0dca9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7a8cd156f4301de735cdfff2fc1acfb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3d18d83a/uploads/origins/cbece493-628f-4461-8012-936183a0dca9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69ca00df37d0c35ef848bb1af501588e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたのファンで、あなたのイラストがとても好きです。\n\n今回のリクエストですが、服のデザインのイラストを希望しています。立っているポーズでも、それ以外のポーズでも、自由に遊んでいただけたらと思います。\nキャラクターはかなり内気で暗い性格なので、よりキャラクターに沿った表現ができればと思います。\n服装はビジュアル系・ジライ系を希望します。\nそのほか、血のついたサンプルと血のついていないサンプルの2種類を希望します。血のある画像については、私が提供したリンクのいずれかを参照してください。\n\nまた、私の要望額はあくまで仮のものですので、もしご期待に添えないようでしたら、遠慮なく変更をお願いします！\n\nキャラクターの外見は以下のリンクを参考にしてください🤲（下の毛先が若干ピンク色になっていますが、画像ではうまく伝わらないかもしれません。）\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1x5ObJNQ7kHiDhv_XLdILBAy65cgxNay-/view?usp=drivesdk\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1iF31vph6K_o2pZfl0UHfhKfS8Ojl_3Wl/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gedraji/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/df43995f/uploads/origins/60a82757-6370-4280-a4cc-b32760911e82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bd439a23021eaf51ba36845b19bc0a5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df43995f/uploads/origins/60a82757-6370-4280-a4cc-b32760911e82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bd439a23021eaf51ba36845b19bc0a5, https://si.imgix.net/df43995f/uploads/origins/60a82757-6370-4280-a4cc-b32760911e82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=644507a1e97fc95d794bddac60cf76bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df43995f/uploads/origins/60a82757-6370-4280-a4cc-b32760911e82?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23bafeb0eb76ca132cd7672b969a757d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの絵が大好きです！私のキャラクターはかわいくておバカな子犬なんだけど、あなたのスタイルで見てみたいわ！<3 https://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/82749299_Fui5EP6PII8cvwN.png\n\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/82749299_Fui5EP6PII8cvwN.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gedraji/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/012fa7ee/uploads/origins/263902f3-4833-4f6b-89e3-401a255f0d53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4512ab33894d680aa2287e4d0b4cbea6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/012fa7ee/uploads/origins/263902f3-4833-4f6b-89e3-401a255f0d53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4512ab33894d680aa2287e4d0b4cbea6, https://si.imgix.net/012fa7ee/uploads/origins/263902f3-4833-4f6b-89e3-401a255f0d53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c575f46c78145e64bd215cdcf339989a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/012fa7ee/uploads/origins/263902f3-4833-4f6b-89e3-401a255f0d53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84612aa248e266ea6c6cc1743a005871 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "これを見てくれてありがとう！女の子である私のOCのために図を描くことを期待しています！\n\n彼女の設定はこんな感じです。\n↓\n\nカオスに捧ぐレクイエム(献给混沌的安魂曲) 地下アイドル\n代表カラーは💙。\n好きなものは光るもの、好きな動物は猫、好きな昆虫は蝶。\n\n表面的には明るくキラキラした女の子で、かわいい顔をしているが、もっと深刻な心の病や精神疾患を持っており、時折自分を傷つけてしまう。\n\nここでは、彼女がどんな子なのかがわかる↓↓。\n\nその他の特徴としては、歯並びが鋭く、知的障害があり、愛情不足の子供である。地下アイドルとして活動中。\nまた、髪の色はヘイズブルーが似合う！できれば、彼女の新しい衣装をデザインしてほしい！ありがとうございます\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Dl8_ICw5cdemseQOhC6iU6Sd5VRmRTM-/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gedraji/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6fd52445/uploads/origins/46286806-5138-4901-aeb4-ce28fb430765?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px